        "type": "standard"
    },
    "description": "On this three-hour private excursion, you’ll explore Madrid’s attractions on board a bike.\r\n\r\nLed by your guide, you’ll glide through the city’s pretty streets and see popular highlights, including Plaza de Cibeles and Puerta del Sol. You’ll also have a chance to admire the main medieval Plaza de la Villa as well as the Royal Palace of Madrid – the official residence of the Spanish royal family in the city.\r\n\r\nDuring your stops, you’ll have a chance to listen to your guide’s commentary about the sites’ historical and cultural significance. You can also tell your guide if you have any special requests to make the tour customised for your preferences.",
